sequenceDiagram
    participant AC as vTaskActuatorControl
    participant JH as Joystick HW
    participant SD as SharedData
    participant SC as vTaskSignalConditioning
    participant SigCond as SignalConditioner
    participant SV as vTaskServoControl
    participant Pot as Potentiometer
    participant Relay as Relay GPIO 23
    participant Servo as Servo GPIO 18
    participant D as vTaskDisplay
    participant Sem as semActuatorDisplay

    Note over AC,Sem: Initial State: Relay OFF, Servo OFF

    AC->>JH: scan()
    AC->>JH: isPressed()
    JH-->>AC: true (button pressed)

    AC->>AC: Check cooldown > 250ms
    AC->>SD: actuator_command = true
    SD-->>AC: confirmed

    AC->>SD: actuator_command_time = now
    AC->>Sem: give()

    Note over SC,Servo: Signal Conditioning Task (50ms)

    SC->>SD: Read actuator_command
    SD-->>SC: true

    SC->>SigCond: conditionSignal(true, 50, 100)
    activate SigCond
    SigCond->>SigCond: debounceSignal(50ms)
    SigCond->>SigCond: validatePersistentState(100ms)
    SigCond-->>SC: true
    deactivate SigCond

    SC->>SD: actuator_state = true
    SC->>Relay: turnOn()
    activate Relay
    Relay->>Relay: digitalWrite(23, HIGH)
    Relay-->>SC: void
    deactivate Relay

    Note over SV,Servo: Servo Control Task (50ms)

    SV->>Pot: scan()
    activate Pot
    Pot->>Pot: analogRead(34)
    Pot-->>SV: raw value (0-4095)
    deactivate Pot

    SV->>SD: potentiometer_percent = 50%
    SV->>SD: servo_speed = 50%

    SV->>SD: servo_enabled = actuator_state
    SD-->>SV: true

    SV->>SV: Calculate angle = 50% * 180 = 90°
    SV->>SD: servo_angle = 90

    SV->>Servo: setAngle(90)
    activate Servo
    Servo->>Servo: PWM output (GPIO 18)
    Servo-->>SV: void
    deactivate Servo

    SV->>Relay: setSpeed(50)
    activate Relay
    Relay->>Relay: Apply speed control
    Relay-->>SV: void
    deactivate Relay

    SV->>Sem: give()

    Note over D,Sem: Display Task (500ms)

    D->>Sem: take(100ms)
    Sem-->>D: true

    D->>SD: Read actuator_state
    SD-->>D: true

    D->>SD: Read servo_speed
    SD-->>D: 50

    D->>D: Format "Act:ON Srv:50%"
    D->>D: Format "Cmd:ON Tog:1"
    D->>D: Update LCD

    Note over AC,Sem: System Running:<br>Relay ON, Servo at 90°